---
title: Contact
seoDescription: How to reach Hotel Atlantis on Ceintuurbaan, by tram, train or from Schiphol.
---
## From Schiphol

The train from Schiphol to Amsterdam Zuid takes about ten minutes; from there tram 24 runs to De Pijp. Allow half an hour door to door. A taxi takes about twenty-five minutes outside the rush.

## From Amsterdam Centraal

Tram 24 runs from the station straight down through the centre and into De Pijp. Get off at Ceintuurbaan and the hotel is on the corner. It is about twenty minutes.

## By car

The hotel has no parking of its own, and on-street parking in De Pijp is metered and scarce. If you are driving, plan on a public garage in the area, or leave the car behind: the tram stops at the end of the street and almost nothing you have come to see needs one.
